      "message": "You should initialize *nr_scanned to 0 because caller passes this parameter uninitialized, using it as an output parameter. But this is not a very good API. Please either use (nr_taken !\u003d 0) as a condition for this bypass or if 0 is a legitimate return value here then add a separate parameter to bypass the rest of the code.",
